  npcName: Khepri
  npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueBubbles:
  - snippets:
    - My name was Khepri.
    - I sailed from Memphis.
    - I traded linen for copper in a society without coins.
  - snippets:
    - I was a master of words.
    - I convinced people that common lapis amulets were blessed by Ptah.
  - snippets:
    - A rival merchant grew tired of my lies.
    - He poisoned my beer during a festival.
    - I swindled the wrong man.
